// Goéland POC - Case export (spec v2 §51, roadmap GLD-029).
//
// Proto-first definition for CaseExportService + supporting messages. An
// export is a background job: RequestCaseExport queues it, a worker builds a
// ZIP archive (a CaseExportManifest as manifest.json, plus every content blob
// once under blobs/<sha256>) into the blob store, and the requester downloads
// it from GET /api/case-exports/{id}/content (out of proto, like document
// content) until it expires.
//
// Exporting needs MANAGE on the case; the archive holds only what the
// requester may read, and the manifest counts what was withheld. Every request,
// granted or refused, is recorded as EXPORT in the sensitive read audit, and so
// is each confidential document placed in an archive.

